      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُفْكَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A portion of food that is presented to a
guest, to content,</i> or <i>satisfy, him,</i> [<i>so as to allay
the craving of his stomach,</i>] <i>before the morningmeal; like</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لُمْجَةٌ</span>. (IAar, O, K. *)

